13-12-17T10:04:12Z","updated_at":"2013-12-17T10:04:12Z","body":"I think problem is that ActiveQuery run QueryBuilder only if $query->sql is null\n\n``` php\nif ($this->sql === null) {\n            if ($this->from === null) {\n                $tableName = $modelClass::tableName();\n                if ($this->select === null && !empty($this->join)) {\n                    $this->select = [\"$tableName.*\"];\n                }\n                $this->from = [$tableName];\n            }\n            list ($this->sql, $params) = $db->getQueryBuilder()->build($this);\n        }\n```\n\nBut if we already run query, sql is not empty. And if params should be taken for $query->where - it never happens. And if we, for example, overload count() for ActiveQuery and set sql to null after command create - all works:\n\n``` php\npublic function count($q = '*', $db = null)\n    {\n        $this->select = [\"COUNT($q)\"];\n        $result = $this->createCommand($db)->queryScalar();\n        $this->sql = null;\n        return $result;\n    }\n```\n\nBut, it should be done every time we create command.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/30738851/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"SonicGD","id":1222013,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjIwMTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1222013?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SonicGD","html_url":"https://github.com/SonicGD","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SonicGD/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SonicGD/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SonicGD/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SonicGD/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SonicGD/subscriptions","organizations_ur